  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Record of PhD Student Publications & Presentations</h1>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Please bring this completed form with you to your final oral dissertation defense. Committee members will not sign off on your dissertation without this completed form.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">1. Peer-reviewed presentations (please list all presentations during your time of doctoral work at TWU)</h2>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">For each presentation, provide the following:</p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <li>Author(s)</li>
    <li>Title</li>
    <li>Name and location of conference/symposium (Ex. CSM in Indianapolis)</li>
    <li>Date (month/year)</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Example:</p>
  <p style="font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 30px;">Blume C, Wang-Price S, Trudelle-Jackson E, Ortiz A. Effectiveness of concentric versus eccentric rotator cuff and scapular muscle progressive resistance exercises in adults with subacromial impingement syndrome. APTA Combined Sections Meeting, Feb 2015; Indianapolis, IN.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">2. Peer-reviewed manuscript submissions (please list all manuscripts submitted during your time of doctoral work at TWU)</h2>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">For each manuscript/publication, please list the following:</p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <li>Status (not published, in review, or accepted)</li>
    <li>Citation for the manuscript/publication (even if not published)</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Examples:</p>
  <p style="font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 30px;">Trudelle-Jackson E, Morrow JR, Leonard D. Musculoskeletal risk factors as predictors of injury in community-dwelling women. Med Sci Sports Exerc, 2014;46(Sept): 1752-1757.</p>
  <p style="font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 40px;">Trudelle-Jackson E, Morrow JR, Leonard D. Musculoskeletal risk factors as predictors of injury in community-dwelling women. Med Sci Sports Exerc (in review).</p>

  <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px;">NOTE: If you submit additional manuscripts or have a presentation accepted AFTER your oral dissertation defense but PRIOR to graduation, please let us know and send us the citation.</p>
</div>
